FL,314,300,200,140,000,100
PN,31305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785170896
OL,3,CBurnham pledges 'unwavering' support
OL,4,Cfor Ukraine ahead of Zelenskyy visit
OL,6,FDuring the visit, the two leaders will
OL,7,Fmeet more than 200 Ukrainian military
OL,8,Fpersonnel who have spent the past
OL,9,Fthree weeks in the UK taking part in
OL,10,FExercise Sea Breeze, aimed at
OL,11,Fstrengthening warfighting capabilities
OL,12,Fand counter-mine measures in the Black
OL,13,FSea.
OL,15,FThe new prime minister spoke to
OL,16,FZelenskyy in one of his first calls
OL,17,Fafter taking office last Monday and
OL,18,Finvited the Ukrainian leader to visit
OL,19,F"at the earliest opportunity".
OL,26,@{D@AOU{D@]O]
