PN,31306
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F313A1785170896
OL,3,CBurnham pledges 'unwavering' support
OL,4,Cfor Ukraine ahead of Zelenskyy visit
OL,6,FBurnham had vowed to maintain his
OL,7,Fpredecessor Sir Keir Starmer's
OL,8,Fresolute support for Ukraine before
OL,9,Fentering No 10.
OL,11,FStarmer visited Kyiv on his final full
OL,12,Fday as Labour leader.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G6/6
